What this covers
----------------

The data records (specifications, prices, joint mappings, sources, figures
and other facts and compilations) in:

- frontend/src/data/actuators.json (the actuator catalog)
- frontend/src/data/robots.json (robots and the motors in each joint)
- src/humanoids/ (humanoid fleet, bill of materials and rare-earth data)
- src/supply-chain/ (companies, sites, magnet metals, market shares,
  reserves, prices and events)
- src/catalog/engineering-evidence.ts (reviewed engineering evidence)
- src/investors.ts and src/startups.ts (investor and startup records)
- src/brands/self-hosted.json (logo provenance records only, not the logos)
- the same data as served by actuatorlist.com, including the REST API,
  the MCP servers, the JSON Lines feed, llms.txt, llms-full.txt and the
  markdown twins of each page

Where a file mixes data with code, the data records fall under this license
and the code falls under the MIT License in LICENSE. All other code in this
repository is MIT licensed.

